  "body_html": "<h1>prefW_strict</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma prefW_strict {j a b : Fin n} : strict ((MatchingMarket.ofEquivData w m).prefW j).rel (some a) (some b) ↔ (m.prefs j).idxOf a &lt; (m.prefs j).idxOf b</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>joinWoman_injective</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
